Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:21:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Label adviser-triggered turns and keep adviser steers out of user intervention

A leftover adviser steer is requeued as the next turn by both live hosts. Persist that
row with display_kind=adviser so every surface draws a card, not a user bubble, and stop
clearing the unattended flag when the steer came from a reviewer.
